s </c><00:00:01.770><c>approximately  </c><00:00:01.771><c>equal </c><00:00:01.772><c>to  </c><00:00:01.773><c>the </c><00:00:01.774><c>change </c><00:00:01.775><c>in </c><00:00:01.776><c>the </c><00:00:01.777><c>enthalpy </c><00:00:01.778><c>for </c><00:00:01.779><c>the  </c><00:00:01.780><c>reaction </c><00:00:01.781><c>as </c><00:00:01.782><c>well</c>

